    "global index": "MMLUPro_physics_8461",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: When light undergoes interference, it can sometimes\n\nOptions: \nA. cancel completely\nB. Both of these\nC. Decrease its frequency\nD. Increase its speed\nE. Transform into a different form of energy\nF. Neither of these\nG. Change its direction\nH. Change its wavelength\nI. Become a particle\nJ. build up to more than the sum of amplitudes\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
