    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: 50 men shake hands with each other . maximum no of handshakes without cyclic handshakes .\n\nOptions: \nA. 190\nB. 200\nC. 1225\nD. 220\nE. 230\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Let’s break it down:  \n- The total possible handshakes among 50 men (if each pair shakes hands once) is  \n\\(\\binom{50}{2} = \\frac{50 \\times 49}{2} = 1225\\).  \n\n- “Without cyclic handshakes” means we avoid forming a cycle in the handshake graph, which limits the graph to a tree structure. A tree on 50 vertices has at most \\(50 - 1 = 49\\) edges.  \nTherefore, the maximum is 49, but this is not among the options, suggesting they might mean the maximum without *repeating* handshakes (which is 1225).  \n\nThe likely intended answer here is **1225**.  \n\n\\[\n\\boxed{C}\n\\]",
