    "global index": "MusicTheoryBench_82",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A beginning cello student plays with too much arm movement; what is most likely causing the problem?\n\nOptions: \nA. The student’s back is slouche\nB. The wrist is not bending properly on a bow stroke.\nC. The thumb is placed too close to the second and third fingers.\nD. \n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
