      "generated_answer": "Their plan is for Sheeni to arrange a job in Ukiah for Nick's father George, while Nick gets his mother to kick him out of the house so he can move back to be with Sheeni.\n\n\\boxed{Sheeni arranges a job for Nick's father in Ukiah and Nick gets his mother to kick him out so he can return to Sheeni.}",
