losest approximation to a powerful, benevolent father figure in Baum's fantasies.\"\n\nQuestion: How was Cap'n Bill feeling when they met the mermaids?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
