hanged history, and Goodwin seemingly recalls something. The email asks her to reassure this timeline's Stevens that \"everything is gonna be okay\". The scene cuts to Stevens who, in this timeline, is still comatose, hooked up to the neural sensors in the airtight chamber.\n\nQuestion: In what city does the train sequence take place?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
