      "generated_answer": "Thomas brought up the rising prominence of Christianity among blacks to counter and refute Froude's stereotypical accusations, such as that they were devil-worshipers, by highlighting their adoption of mainstream religious practices.\n\n\\boxed{Thomas brought up the rising prominence of Christianity among blacks to counter Froude's stereotypical accusations, particularly the charge of devil-worship, by showing their adoption of mainstream religion.}",
