1.7]), and allergy overall (with PSV 2.2 [1.2-3.9], with WG 2.7 [1.4-5.7]). No other significant associations were found.']\n\nQuestion: Are environmental factors important in primary systemic vasculitis?\n\nOptions: \nA. yes\nB. no\nC. maybe\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
