    "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: This work argues that scientific laws are used as \"inference-tickets\" between factual statements as part of its argument that not all indicative sentences report facts.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
